af",description:"Read the land. Bring home what it offers."},{id:"making",name:"Timber & thread",icon:"planks",description:"From a fallen branch to a carefully joined frame."},{id:"homestead",name:"A living home",icon:"home",description:"Food, warmth, gardens and a place to belong."},{id:"craft",name:"Earth & fire",icon:"fire",description:"Clay, charcoal, metal and bright little inventions."},{id:"community",name:"Life together",icon:"market",description:"Useful places, generous work and shared independence."},{id:"discovery",name:"Curious minds",icon:"research",description:"Practice, observation and the next good question."}],teachingStyles:[{id:"together",name:"Side by side",rate:1,practice:3,bond:3,joy:5,desc:"A patient lesson: +3 starting practice and +3 friendship."},{id:"playful",name:"Learn through play",rate:.85,practice:2,bond:2,joy:14,desc:"A gentler pace: +14 joy, +2 friendship and less mental effort."},{id:"independent",name:"Room to try",rate:1.2,practice:1,bond:1,joy:4,desc:"20% faster lessons; +1 starting practice, with more mental effort."}],buildingApproaches:[{id:"balanced",name:"Steady paws",time:1,quality:0,desc:"Standard work time. A dependable finish."},{id:"careful",name:"Made with care",time:1.35,quality:18,desc:"35% more work time; +18 finish quality; +1 practice per stage."},{id:"quick",name:"Simple & useful",time:.78,quality:-12,desc:"22% less work time; \\u221212 finish quality. Still fully usable."}],talents:[{id:"gatherer",name:"Gentle forager",desc:"+1 item per natural harvest, limited by the node\\u2019s remaining stock.",discipline:"woodland"},{id:"explorer",name:"Field observer",desc:"Exploration is 20% faster and earns +1 shared research.",discipline:"woodland"},{id:"maker",name:"Patient craftspaw",desc:"Timber and thread recipes work 15% faster.",discipline:"making"},{id:"builder",name:"Thoughtful builder",desc:"Completed buildings and upgrades gain +12 finish quality.",discipline:"making"},{id:"comfort",name:"Keeper of home",desc